NODE id=matrix/cortex/embed.APIEmbedder.Embed kind=method
  digest=b3:e547111106bd8378de33e965536b6981ccb6f8b84354449930a55cfcd9121ac8 file=cortex/embed/api_embedder.go range=177:194 lang=go exported=true byte_range=6063:6804
  sig=func (e *APIEmbedder) Embed(text string) ([]float32, error)
  doc=Embed implements Embedder. The text is sent verbatim to the provider; the\nresponse vector is L2-normalised before return (most providers already\nnormalise but we enforce for HNSW cosine-via-dot-product correctness).\n\nEmpty text: returns ErrEmptyInput rather than the deterministic-stub fallback\nof HashEmbedder. Production embedders typically reject empty inputs.\n\nRetries: transient errors (network failure, 5xx, 429 rate-limit) are\nretried with exponential backoff up to MaxRetries.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/cortex/embed.APIEmbedder
  ^defines=matrix/cortex/embed/api_embedder.go

